{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"y":0.06976744171613769,"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.12139918009440104,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"x":0.096707817249561623},{"w":0.67901234944661459,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.098765430128442702,"y":0.11482558124884723,"t":"Right. Now I'd just like to make a few points about the plays we're going to see, partly"},{"c":1,"t":"because it might influence your choice of clothes to take with you!","x":0.10082303325031082,"y":0.13074204924493205,"w":0.52263376871744793,"h":0.013250883392226243},{"h":0.01472320376914027,"c":1,"t":"The play we're seeing on Wednesday evening is a modern one, and we're going to the","x":0.098765428735065081,"y":0.1525323909695262,"w":0.69135803222656245},{"t":"Q16","h":0.013081394460653484,"c":1,"x":0.85185185276403863,"w":0.037037035624186143,"y":0.15261627935034183},{"y":0.16860465102754651,"t":"premiere, so it'll be quite a dressy occasion, though of course you don't have to dress","c":1,"w":0.6769547526041666,"h":0.014552004064912638,"x":0.10082303520809982},{"t":"formally. I gather it's rather a multimedia production, with amazing lighting effects and a","y":0.18459302313612269,"x":0.10082304140171373,"c":1,"w":0.69135803222656256,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.098765430824839101,"y":0.19905771516350723,"t":"soundtrack of electronic music, though unfortunately the playwright is ill and is unlikely to be","w":0.73045267740885411,"c":1},{"t":"able to attend.","x":0.098765434984868727,"w":0.11934155782063802,"y":0.21643109531464289,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"t":"On Thursday we're seeing a play that was first performed last year, when it was","h":0.014572547939556646,"c":1,"y":0.23837209288682659,"w":0.63580245971679683,"x":0.10082304999263035},{"x":0.85185185246144846,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q17","y":0.23837209286722738,"w":0.037037035624186143,"c":1},{"w":0.72851145426432296,"h":0.016294131149813151,"x":0.098689168372160907,"c":1,"t":"commissioned to mark a hundred years since the birth in the town of a well-known scientist.","y":0.2522673441169111},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"y":0.2688457009111489,"x":0.10082303548781486,"t":"We're going to see a revival of that production, which aroused a lot of interest.","w":0.6193415832519531},{"y":0.29210836301096199,"t":"Friday's play will really make you think hard about what clothes to pack, as it'll be in the","x":0.1008230496349673,"h":0.01472320376914027,"c":1,"w":0.69341562906901033},{"w":0.037037035624186143,"x":0.85185185246144846,"t":"Q18","h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.29215116263466923,"c":1},{"x":0.10082305051416948,"w":0.68724278767903646,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"t":"garden of a palace. It's a beautiful setting, but I'd better warn you, there won't be much","y":0.30800942280902543},{"x":0.10082304227033187,"y":0.3241279068513101,"w":0.19958848317464192,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"protection from the wind."},{"h":0.015638189686482118,"w":0.79023574829101562,"y":0.34534674207447646,"t":"On Saturday, we're going by coach to a theatre in another town, not far from Munich. This will Q19","c":1,"x":0.10077050518006028},{"h":0.01647645536946174,"y":0.36029512957623311,"t":"be the opening of a drama festival, and the mayor and all the other dignitaries of the town will","x":0.1007551394292967,"c":1,"w":0.74292724609375005},{"h":0.01472320376914027,"w":0.74074076334635408,"y":0.37632508817779553,"c":1,"x":0.10288064716659458,"t":"be attending. After the performance, the mayor is hosting a reception for all the audience, and"},{"x":0.10082304710869172,"t":"there'll be a band playing traditional music of the region.","c":1,"w":0.44855967203776037,"h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.39244186018915217},{"y":0.41569767428447846,"t":"And after having a day off on Sunday, our final play is on Monday, and it's in the stunning","c":1,"w":0.70987655639648439,"x":0.10082303859714954,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.4156976742625762,"t":"Q20","x":0.85390946563017256,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"x":0.10074542136270291,"w":0.74292673746744786,"c":1,"h":0.018267720270774723,"y":0.42798000709435657,"t":"setting of the old Town Hall. which dates back to the 14iẠạicentury. The performance marks the"},{"h":0.015665194732702004,"c":1,"y":0.44522510550539995,"x":0.10282305370684791,"w":0.72645655314127611,"t":"fifty years that the lead actor has been on stage, and the play is the one where he made his"},{"x":0.10275965797778032,"w":0.39938880920410158,"y":0.46191493630129021,"c":1,"h":0.015583446084821095,"t":"first professional appearance, all those years ago."},{"y":0.48546511614636612,"t":"And the day after that, we'll be flying back home. Now have you got any questions before I...","c":1,"x":0.10082303385884606,"w":0.74074076334635419,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"t":"SECTION 3","y":0.54358068335581844,"w":0.15432098388671872,"h":0.014558851648696858,"x":0.10288066021852475,"c":1},{"x":0.10288065787659122,"w":0.041152264277140291,"t":"BETH:","h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"y":0.57412790687542525},{"y":0.57122093009961361,"t":"Oh good morning. You must be James. I'm Beth Cartwright - please call me Beth.","w":0.66666666666666663,"x":0.15432098755275925,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"x":0.10259791077707726,"t":"JAMES: Thank you.","y":0.58514118276802163,"w":0.15905311584472659,"h":0.015765053082972713,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"t":"BETH:","x":0.10082304492913392,"w":0.043209877014160139,"y":0.60465116267249219},{"c":1,"x":0.16872427003078666,"y":0.60174418592590151,"w":0.6193415832519531,"t":"Now as this is your first tutorial since you started on the Scandinavian Studies","h":0.013096803209104779},{"y":0.6162790696126621,"x":0.16872428557538599,"t":"course, I'd like to find out something about you. Why did you decide to take this","w":0.62962961832682285,"c":1,"h":0.015988372380376759},{"w":0.065953998565673827,"t":"course?","x":0.17072670524202796,"h":0.011943828371584919,"c":1,"y":0.6321094809652984},{"t":"JAMES: Well, my mother is Danish, and although we always lived in England, she used to","h":0.013250883392226243,"w":0.71810699462890626,"c":1,"x":0.10082304580156157,"y":0.64811542994154958},{"t":"talk about her home a lot, and that made me want to visit Denmark. We hardly ever","c":1,"y":0.6627906975230391,"w":0.66460906982421875,"x":0.16666665909435741,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"c":1,"t":"did, though - my mother usually went on her own. But whenever her relations or","y":0.67804922136146528,"h":0.014217423887219027,"x":0.17071762312465799,"w":0.63797760009765625},{"c":1,"t":"friends were in England they always came tosee us.","x":0.17078189231440821,"w":0.41975308736165362,"h":0.011778563015312216,"y":0.69464075358680555},{"y":0.71220930219501832,"c":1,"w":0.043209877014160167,"h":0.010174418787512574,"t":"BETH:","x":0.10082304488165054},{"t":"I see. So I assume you already speak Danish, one of the languages you'll be","w":0.61111109415690112,"c":1,"x":0.16872428818519419,"y":0.70930232546053829,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"h":0.013769349726125424,"c":1,"t":"studying.","x":0.16860877387772152,"y":0.72640020882800971,"w":0.076362698872884077},{"t":"JAMES:","x":0.10288065896126702,"y":0.7441860464143002,"c":1,"w":0.051440327962239601,"h":0.0087209303892965551},{"c":1,"x":0.10279493368060415,"t":"BETH:","y":0.75851461914749951,"w":0.041323712666829424,"h":0.0091335523535702734},{"t":"I can get by when I talk to people, though I'm not terribly accurate.","c":1,"h":0.016553044178741372,"w":0.52892369588216148,"y":0.73898250737408078,"x":0.16866084267116907},{"y":0.75581395335369683,"w":0.65843622843424476,"x":0.16872427257621969,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"Now you probably know that you'll spend the third year of the course abroad. Have"},{"t":"you had any thoughts about that?","y":0.77179034162416105,"h":0.01309337941721278,"x":0.17078189873786309,"w":0.26748970031738284,"c":1},{"t":"JAMES:","x":0.10288065771340509,"y":0.78924418589855638,"c":1,"w":0.053497943878173818,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"w":0.65432098388671878,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132,"t":"I'm really looking forward to it. And although Denmark seems the obvious place to","x":0.16460905533363018,"y":0.78621908105984639},{"x":0.17078190328530005,"y":0.80232558127496356,"w":0.59876541137695305,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"go, because of my family connections, I'd love to spend the time in Iceland.","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"BETH:","y":0.82122093013123909,"w":0.043209877014160167,"x":0.10493827125575293,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"t":"Oh, I'm sure it can be arranged. Do you have any plans for when you graduate? A lot","x":0.16872427784902375,"h":0.014534883982160851,"w":0.67901234944661459,"c":1,"y":0.81831395335553436},{"c":1,"x":0.17078189822334841,"w":0.35390945434570309,"h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.83421672562066607,"t":"of students go on to take a master's degree."},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.047325102488199877,"t":"JAMES:","c":1,"y":0.85174418594832213,"x":0.1049382716936105},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"x":0.16872428005111828,"t":"I think the four years of the undergraduate course will be enough for me. I'm.","y":0.84883720918231298,"w":0.60905349731445313},{"x":0.16872428612370413,"w":0.68106994628906248,"t":"interested in journalism, and I quite like the idea of moving to Scandinavia and writing","y":0.86336866909587096,"h":0.01453830777405285,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"for magazines. I'd find that more creative than translating, which I suppose most","x":0.1687242753612542,"w":0.63991770426432293,"h":0.016195524146054185,"y":0.87926972886780685},{"t":"graduates do.","w":0.11526429494222007,"x":0.1707629133662914,"y":0.895264887135237,"h":0.013249295058323396,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Q21","h":0.013081394460653373,"x":0.85596707910148706,"y":0.64680232586196984,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"Q22","w":0.037037035624186143,"c":1,"x":0.85802469195551756,"y":0.84883720916363348},{"y":0.94186046496025067,"t":"102","h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.10493827221453486,"w":0.037037035624186199,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.39471442585841338,"y":0.96641811852927229,"w":0.2085117212931315,"h":0.017806331737864278}]}